repository-code: 'https://github.com/SJDietz/contralog-anomaly-detection'
abstract: >-
  ContraLog is a self-supervised method for detecting
  anomalies in log files without relying on log parsers.
  Traditional approaches first parse log messages into
  discrete templates, discarding variable values and
  semantic content. ContraLog instead operates directly on
  raw log messages by predicting continuous message
  embeddings.
keywords:
  - Anomaly detection
  - Contrastive learning
  - Masked language modeling
  - Log file processing
